{
  "esm": "0.7.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "NCEPNCAR_Surface_loader",
    "description": "Pure-I/O data loader for the NCEP/NCAR Reanalysis 1 static surface geopotential height (hgt.sfc.nc) on the native 2.5°×2.5° global longitude/latitude grid, from NOAA PSL.\n\nThis is the static loader half of the ncep_ncar loader+regridding-model split (RFC pure-io-data-loaders §4.1/§7; bead esm-3nc.2). It is PURE I/O with NO `temporal` block (kind: static) → CONST cadence (ess-v9a.5): the surface geopotential does not vary in time and is folded once at bind. It performs NO reprojection and NO regridding — those are per-variable concerns of the regridding model (components/earthsci_data/ncep_ncar.esm), which references this file as the subsystem NCEPNCAR_Surface via {\"ref\": \"./ncep_ncar_surface_loader.esm\"}.\n\nThe removed co-located blocks: the old DataLoaderSpatial block is replaced by the GDD `grid`; the old per-loader `regridding` block is gone — regridding (conservative, centered) is declared on the model `regrid` for hgt_sfc.\n\nMigrated from EarthSciData.jl src/NCEP-NCAR_Reanalysis.jl (NCEPNCARReanalysisFileSet, surface variables). Split out of the pre-migration components/earthsci_data/ncep_ncar.esm (esm-k3bb).",
    "tags": [
      "earthsci_data",
      "meteorology",
      "reanalysis",
      "ncep",
      "ncar",
      "surface",
      "static",
      "data_loader",
      "pure-io",
      "longlat"
    ],
    "created": "2026-06-25T00:00:00Z",
    "authors": [
      "NOAA NCEP",
      "NCAR",
      "EarthSciModels migration (esm-3nc.2)"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Kalnay, E., Kanamitsu, M., Kistler, R., Collins, W., Deaven, D., Gandin, L., Iredell, M., Saha, S., White, G., Woollen, J., Zhu, Y., Leetmaa, A., Reynolds, R., Chelliah, M., Ebisuzaki, W., Higgins, W., Janowiak, J., Mo, K. C., Ropelewski, C., Wang, J., Jenne, R., Joseph, D. (1996). The NCEP/NCAR 40-year reanalysis project. Bulletin of the American Meteorological Society, 77(3), 437–471.",
        "url": "https://psl.noaa.gov/data/gridded/data.ncep.reanalysis.html",
        "doi": "10.1175/1520-0477(1996)077<0437:TNYRP>2.0.CO;2"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Source: EarthSciData.jl src/NCEP-NCAR_Reanalysis.jl:4-66 (NCEPNCARReanalysisFileSet), :72-79 (relpath), :224 (NCEPNCARReanalysis constructor). Test: test/NCEP-NCAR_Reanalysis_test.jl."
      }
    ]
  },
  "data_loaders": {
    "NCEPNCAR_Surface": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "https://downloads.psl.noaa.gov/Datasets/ncep.reanalysis/surface/{var}.sfc.nc"
      },
      "grid": {
        "family": "cartesian",
        "crs": {
          "projection": "longlat",
          "datum": "WGS84"
        },
        "description": "Native NCEP/NCAR Reanalysis 1 grid: regular global 2.5°×2.5° longitude/latitude lattice (single static surface level). Geographic (unprojected) longlat/WGS84 crs — the regridding model applies the longlat IDENTITY reprojection (ESD reprojection/longlat.esm, esd-47z.1). Migrated from the loader's former DataLoaderSpatial block (RFC pure-io-data-loaders §4.1). Documented native geometry: lon ∈ [-180°,180°] (144 cells, 2.5°), lat ∈ [-90°,90°] (72 cells, 2.5°).",
        "dimensions": [
          "lon",
          "lat"
        ],
        "extents": {
          "lon": {
            "n": 144,
            "spacing": "uniform"
          },
          "lat": {
            "n": 72,
            "spacing": "uniform"
          }
        }
      },
      "variables": {
        "hgt_sfc": {
          "file_variable": "hgt",
          "units": "m",
          "description": "Surface geopotential height (static). Read from 'hgt.sfc.nc' on the NOAA PSL server. The variable name in the file is 'hgt'; the schema-level name 'hgt_sfc' distinguishes it from the pressure-level geopotential height in NCEPNCAR_Pressure."
        }
      },
      "reference": {
        "citation": "Kalnay, E. et al. (1996). The NCEP/NCAR 40-year reanalysis project. Bull. Amer. Meteor. Soc. 77, 437–471.",
        "url": "https://psl.noaa.gov/data/gridded/data.ncep.reanalysis.html"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "meteorology",
          "static",
          "surface",
          "geopotential",
          "ncep",
          "ncar"
        ],
        "earthscidata_source": "src/NCEP-NCAR_Reanalysis.jl::NCEPNCARReanalysisFileSet (surface variables)",
        "native_resolution_deg": {
          "longitude": 2.5,
          "latitude": 2.5
        },
        "native_extent": {
          "longitude": [
            -180.0,
            180.0
          ],
          "latitude": [
            -90.0,
            90.0
          ]
        },
        "regridding_provenance": "Former co-located data_loaders.regridding block (fill_value=0.0, extrapolation=clamp) removed in the 0.6.0 hard break; regridding is now per-variable on the model `regrid`.",
        "cadence_note": "No `temporal` block (kind: static) → CONST cadence (ess-v9a.5): the static surface geopotential is folded once at bind."
      }
    }
  }
}
